  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Client-only application tier",
      "items": [
        "No server-side app tier: order, pricing, address and invoice logic all run in GetX controllers on the buyer device, which calls JDE directly.",
        "DraftTable stages order lines in vytl and clears them only after a successful submit. One codebase targets Windows, Android, iOS and web."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Client-held credentials",
      "items": [
        "JDEMAPP password and two Basic-Auth headers are compiled into the binary (api.dart:34, :128, :244).",
        "OTP is generated on-device and compared locally, not server-challenged (api.dart:171).",
        "Password stored in plaintext in SharedPreferences, and interceptors log full bodies (login_controller.dart:247, api.dart:73)."
      ]
    }
  ]
